          "quote": "`U8` `SW`(5) drives the buck inductor `L1` (3.9 µH) and bootstrap cap `C13`"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The 3.3 V buck converter may fail to start or regulate correctly, causing an unstable or absent 3.3 V rail and affecting the ESP32, thermocouple interfaces, and status LED.",
      "confidence": 0.88
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The files show a clear power-regulation anomaly: the AP63203WU bootstrap capacitor C13 is 100 pF instead of the standard ~100 nF bootstrap value, which would likely prevent reliable 3.3 V regulation."
}

